"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook#038;body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F895100243677631_122148747927090118%20-%20%0A%09Thank%20you%2C%20Representative%20Calvin%20Callahan%2C%20for%20blocking%20efforts%20to%20subvert%20our%20elections%20in%20Wisconsin.Unlike%20my%20Democrat%20opponent%2C%20Fred%20Clark%2C%20I%20support%20voter%20ID%20and%20I%20will%20always%20protect%20the%20sanctity%20of%20every%20Wisconsin%20vote.I%20stepped%20into%20this%20lawsuit%20to%20defend%20Wisconsin%20law%20and%20stop%20a%20last-minute%20attempt%20to%20let%20voters%20who%20already%20returned%20an%20absentee%20ballot%20cast%20another%20ballot%20at%20the%20polls.The%20court%20granted%20my%20motion%20to%20intervene%20and%20denied%20the%20request%20to%20change%20the%20rules%20before%20Election%20Day.I%E2%80%99ll%20stay%20in%20this%20fight%20until%20it%E2%80%99s%20finished.%20One%20person.%20One%20ballot.%20Read%20more%20here%3A%20tinyurl.com%2F2hu85s7x%20%20%09%0A%09"
},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook#038;body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F895100243677631_122148754095090118%20-%20%0A%09I%20am%20incredibly%20honored%20to%20have%20earned%20the%20endorsement%20of%20Wisconsin%20Right%20to%20Life.I%20have%20always%20been%20pro-life.%20But%20becoming%20the%20father%20of%20a%20newborn%20daughter%20has%20deepened%20my%20sense%20of%20responsibility%20to%20stand%20up%20for%20those%20who%20cannot%20yet%20speak%20for%20themselves.In%20Congress%2C%20I%20will%20never%20waver%20in%20my%20commitment%20to%20protecting%20the%20unborn%20and%20defending%20the%20God-given%20dignity%20of%20every%20human%20life.%20%09%0A%09"
},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
